{"headword":"גֶּ֫פֶן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 9:13\" href=\"/Judges.9.13\">Ju 9:13</a></sup> + (<strong>m.</strong> only <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:1\" href=\"/Hosea.10.1\">Ho 10:1</a>, perhaps infl. of <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׂרָאֵל</span>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:39\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.39\">2 K 4:39</a>) <strong>vine (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَفْنٌ</span> (Yemen), Assyrian <em>gapnu</em>, cf. Zehnpfund<sup>BAS i. 633</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹפַן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּפֶן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܦܶܬܳܐ</span>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܘܽܦ</span>̈<span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܶܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:9\" href=\"/Genesis.40.9\">Gn 40:9</a> + 38 times (also cstr., as <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:4\" href=\"/Numbers.6.4\">Nu 6:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.8\">Is 16:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.9\">9</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֑פֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:12\" href=\"/Judges.9.12\">Ju 9:12</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּפְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:7\" href=\"/Joel.1.7\">Jo 1:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּפְנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.17\">Je 5:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּפְנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.5\">1 K 5:5</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּפְנָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:14\" href=\"/Hosea.2.14\">Ho 2:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּפְנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a> + 2 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּפָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.13\">Ct 2:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a>—<em>vine</em> (always grape-bearing except <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:39\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.39\">2 K 4:39</a>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:9\" href=\"/Genesis.40.9\">Gn 40:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:10\" href=\"/Genesis.40.10\">10</a> (in dream) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:11\" href=\"/Genesis.49.11\">49:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:5\" href=\"/Numbers.20.5\">Nu 20:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.8\">Dt 8:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:12\" href=\"/Judges.9.12\">Ju 9:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:13\" href=\"/Judges.9.13\">13</a> (in allegory) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.5\">1 K 5:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.31\">2 K 18:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.16\">Is 36:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:47\" href=\"/Psalms.78.47\">ψ 78:47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:33\" href=\"/Psalms.105.33\">105:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.13\">Ct 2:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.11\">6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.13\">7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.23\">Is 7:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.7\">24:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.12\">32:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.17\">Je 5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.13\">8:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:14\" href=\"/Hosea.2.14\">Ho 2:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:7\" href=\"/Joel.1.7\">Jo 1:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:12\" href=\"/Joel.1.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:22\" href=\"/Joel.2.22\">2:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:4\" href=\"/Micah.4.4\">Mi 4:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:19\" href=\"/Haggai.2.19\">Hg 2:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.10\">Zc 2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.12\">8:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:11\" href=\"/Malachi.3.11\">Mal 3:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּפֶ